:: Ash Farmstead Intro
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
You make your way down the worn dirt road and arrive at a small farmstead. There is not much land, only encompassing a small patch of farmland, a cottage, and a barn. As you approach you see someone on the porch stand. It's Ash.
<br><br>
"Oh wow, ya really came! I mean... I knew ya would. I never doubted it for a second." Ash tries to hide <<his>> obvious excitement. "Come in, come in, make yourself at home."
<br><br>
<<link [[Come inside|Ash Mintro]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ash Mintro
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
As you enter the cottage, you are met by... Mint Mocha?! She looks away from you ashamed. Ash looks between the two of you confused. "Am I missin' somethin'? What's wrong with ya both?"
<br><br>
Mint Mocha clears her throat before speaking. "I-I'm sorry. After my... failure, my trainer wanted to get rid of me and Ash took me in..." You can tell from her eyes that she has been crying a lot lately.
<br><br>
You take a moment to explain your relationship with her and Ash listens quietly nodding along. 
<<if $pronoun is "m">>
Ash looks confused. "She? Mint here is a stallion, were you not aware?" Mint Mocha's face burns red as Ash lifts <<his>> skirt revealing <<his>> <<genitals>>. Mint speaks up embarrassed. "<<pShe>> doesn't need to know that! Ugh whatever, yeah I'm a boy so what, you gonna laugh at me or something?" Mint pouts.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Ash stands back a few steps before slipping on a pair of work gloves. "Anyway, I got some workin' to do so you two stay outta trouble."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ash Farmhouse]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ash Farmhouse
You are inside Ash's farmhouse. The small cabin is only about four rooms, consisting of a combined kitchen, dining, and living room, two bedrooms, and a bathroom.
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour lt 4>>
    The farmhouse is quiet. You can hear gentle snoring from Ash's room.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 6>>
    You can hear quiet rustling by the barn outside.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8>>
    Ash and Mint Mocha are sitting at the table for breakfast.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 18>>
    You are alone inside, Ash and Mint are outside working on the farm.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 21>>
    Ash and Mint Mocha are sitting at the table for dinner.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 23>>
    The farmhouse is quiet. Ash and Mint must be in their rooms.
<<else>>
    The farmhouse is quiet. You can hear gentle snoring from Ash's room.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour is 6 or Time.hour is 7>>
<<link [[Eat Breakfast with Ash and Mint (1:00)|Ash Breakfast]]>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom -= 1>><<set C.npc.Ash.love += 2>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>><<ldom>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<if Time.hour is 21 or Time.hour is 22>>
<<link [[Eat dinner with Ash and Mint (1:00)|Ash Dinner]]>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom -= 1>><<set C.npc.Ash.love += 2>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>><<ldom>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Enter Ash's Room (0:02)|Ash Room]]>><<pass 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Enter Mint Mocha's Room (0:02)|Mint Room]]>><<pass 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave (0:05)|Ash Farmstead]]>><<pass 5>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ash Farmstead
You are on Ash's farmstead, a small garden grows various plants and you can hear the sound of pigs, sheep, cows, and other animals from the barn.
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour lt 4>>
    The farm is quiet in the dead of night, everyone must be sleeping.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 6>>
    Ash is out early, feeding the barn animals and milking the cows.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8>>
    It must be breakfast time, Ash and Mint are probably inside.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 18>>
    Ash and Mint are both outside doing farmwork.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 21>>
    Ash and Mint have headed inside for dinner.
<<else>>
    The farm is quiet in the dead of night, everyone must be sleeping.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 18>>
    <<link [[Help Ash with farmwork (1:00)|Ash Farmwork]]>><<endevent>><<pass 60>><<tending 2>><<tiredness 12>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><</link>><<gglove>><<ldom>><<gtiredness>><<gtending>>
    <br>
<</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 16>>
    <<link [[Help Mint with farmwork (1:00)|Mint Farmwork]]>><<endevent>><<pass 60>><<tending 2>><<tiredness 12>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><</link>><<gglove>><<ldom>><<gtiredness>><<gtending>>
    <br>
<</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 16 and Time.hour lt 18>>
    <<link [[Stretch with Mint (1:00)|Mint Exercise]]>><<endevent>><<pass 60>><<stress -10>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><</link>><<gglove>><<ldom>><<lstress>>
    <br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Plant plot|Ash Plot]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Enter Ash's farmhouse (0:05)|Ash Farmhouse]]>><<pass 5>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Enter Ash's barn (0:02)|Ash Barn]]>><<pass 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave (0:10)|Farmland]]>><<pass 10>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ash Breakfast
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
You enter the kitchen and gently slide beside Ash. <<He>> looks to you with a smile and lets you take the pan. You finish cooking the fresh eggs while Ash begins readying the plates and setting cups filled with clear water.
<br><br>
As breakfast finishes, the three of you sit together at the table and Ash offers a silent prayer. It does not take long before the plates are cleaned and the table is clear. Ash and Mint Mocha take a moment of silent peace before beginning the long day ahead.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ash Farmhouse]]>><<set $dailyashbreakfast to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ash Dinner
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
You enter the dining room and Ash guides you to a chair at the small table. Mint Mocha sits poking beside you blushing slightly. You sit together silently as Ash turns off the stove and makes <<his>> way over with a plate of fresh vegetables and meat.
<br><br>
The three of you sit together at the table and Ash offers a silent prayer. It does not take long before the plates are cleaned and the table is clear. Ash and Mint Mocha take a moment of silent peace before returning to their rools.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ash Farmhouse]]>><<set $dailyashdinner to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

