:: Mint Farmwork
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
You step onto the farm's cracked earth, the smell of turned soil greeting you after the rain. Mint Mocha stands near a low fence, <<his>> usual sparkle dimmed, hands gripping a rough burlap sack of seed. "I never imagined I'd be here, pulling weeds instead of chasing a finish line."
<br><br>
You offer a tired smile. <<He>> looks up, a flicker of something returning to <<his>> gaze. "I thought winning would fix everything. Turns out I had to lose to see how much I still have to learn."
<br><br>
<<He>> bends, placing seeds in neat rows, <<his>> movements deliberate but gentle. You crouch beside <<his>>, handing over a small hoe. Your hands brush occasionally as you work side by side.
<br><br>
The two of you spend some time working Ash's farm plots. <<He>> wipes sweat from <<his>> forehead, a small smile forming.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ash Farmstead]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mint Exercise
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
You both settle onto the soft grass, legs stretched out. Mint rolls <<his>> shoulders, feeling the tension loosen. You follow, reaching your arms overhead, fingers interlaced, pulling gently to lengthen the spine.
<br><br>
A soft chuckle escapes as you both attempt a forward bend, fingertips grazing the damp earth. Mint shakes <<his>> head, a mirthful glint returning to <<his>> eyes. "Feels good to let the muscles breathe after all that pulling."
<br><br>
You nod, breathing in the scent of turned soil and wild mint that clings to the air. Together you shift into a side stretch, left arm arching over the head, right hand resting on the hip. The movement eases the knot in your lower back.
<br><br>
After several times, you both settle back, lying flat, eyes closed, listening to the distant chirp of crickets. The day's exertion fades, replaced by a calm steadiness.
<br><br>
Mint turns <<his>> head toward you, a faint smile playing on <<his>> lips. "Thanks for staying. It helps to have someone alongside when the work feels endless."
<br><br>
You reply with a quiet affirmation, feeling the warmth of the sun on your skin and the quiet respect that has grown between you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ash Farmstead]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mint Talk
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
You approach and attempt a conversation with Mint Mocha.
<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<addinlineevent "minttime1">>
    You find Mint perched on the windowsill, legs dangling, staring out at the moonlit fields. He turns his head as you enter, a soft smile forming. "The moon looks like it's watching over us tonight."
    <br><br>
    You join him, resting your elbows on the sill, feeling the cool night breeze.
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "minttime2">>
    He glances up, a faint grin tugging at the corner of his mouth. "Another day in the fields… feels like I've hauled half the harvest on my back."
    <br><br>
    He stretches his arms overhead, fingers interlaced, and lets out a soft groan as the tension eases. "Feels nice to finally let the muscles breathe. Night air has a different kind of weight."
<</addinlineevent>>
<<runeventpool>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mint Room]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

