:: Ash Animals
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
You spend some time with Ash helping with the early morning chores.
<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<addinlineevent "ashanimals1">>
    You help spread feed in the sheep, pig, and cow food troughs. They begin to sloppily eat as Ash helps guide you through assisting the animals.
    <br><br>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "ashanimals2">>
    You spend some time helping Ash milk the cows. It's hard work and builds up a sweat but by the time you are done, you have a full bucket of milk.
    <br><br>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "ashanimals3">>
    Stepping into the small chicken coop, you can see a handful of chickens sitting quietly in the hay. You take a moment to carefully check all of the nests and collect the eggs without disturbing the chickens.
    <br><br>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<runeventpool>>
Ash smiles gently toward you. "Thanks for the help sugar, it's hard work but it's nice to know ya there to help."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ash Barn]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ash Farmwork
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
You meet Ash near the barn to help with work.
<<cleareventpool>>
<<addinlineevent "ashfarm1">>
    "Hey there sugar, ready to get the plot prepared for plantin'?"
    <br><br>
    You nod, grabbing a sturdy hoe from the rack. Together you stride to the furrows. Ash takes the lead, pulling the old plow. <<His>> muscles strain as the blade cuts clean lines in the earth.
    <br><br>
    You follow and help fix up the rough patches, getting the land well prepared for the future.
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "ashfarm2">>
    "You ready for a hard day of workin'?" Ash flashes a cocky smile as he hands you a bag.
    <br><br>
    You follow Ash's lead as <<he>> gently spreads seed across the tilled ground. By the time you are done, you can see small seeds settled throughout the tilled soil.
<</addinlineevent>>
<<runeventpool>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ash Farmland]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ash Talk
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
You sit next to Ash and try to have a conversation.
<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<addinlineevent "ashhome1">>
    Ash turns to face you and gently grips your hands. "Hey sugar. I just wanted to let ya know. I'm sorry about the harsh trainin' I gave ya back at the academy. You've done so much for me and... you make me wanna do better so, thank you." <<He>> gently kisses you and holds your hand for a moment.
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "ashhome2">>
    "Hey sugar," Ash says, turning to face you with a small smile. "Was there somethin' ya wanted to talk about, or did ya just wanna spend some time together?" You and Ash spend some time keeping each other company.
<</addinlineevent>>
<<runeventpool>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ash Room]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mint Romance
Mint gingerly takes your hand into <<his>>, the red glow across <<his>> face growing even brighter. "Well... we've known each other for a while but... I've never been true to you, or myself. The truth is, you are someone I truly love and respect and I want to..." Mint turns and takes a deep breath trying to calm down. "D-do you accept me as your <<girl_npc>>friend?!" <<He>> blurts out as fast as <<he>> can. "Y-you don't have to agree right away, o-or even ever. J-just please keep it in mind okay?"
<br><br>
<<set $mintromance to 1>>
<<if $loveInterest.primary is "None">>
    <<set $loveInterest.primary to "Mint Mocha">>
    <span class = "gold">Mint Mocha is now your love interest! The thought makes you feel warm.</span>
    <br><br>
<<else>>
    <span class = "gold">Mint Mocha can now be claimed as your love interest! The thought makes you feel warm. <br>You can change your love interest in the "Attitudes" menu.</span>
    <br><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Next|Mint Room]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

